<https://decision-cli.dev/ns/result/VGR-315/step/0> <https://decision-cli.dev/ns#stdoutExcerpt> "Project name [ENV-002-535443-1779906845760662036]: \nProduct description — a single statement of what the product is and is not (FT-039).\nDescription (blank to skip): \nCommon concern domains (enter numbers separated by spaces, or blank to skip):\n  [1] security — Authentication, authorisation, secrets, trust boundaries\n  [2] error-handling — Error model, diagnostics, exit codes, recovery\n  [3] storage — Persistence, durability, backup\n  [4] networking — DNS, mTLS, service discovery, port allocation\n  [5] api — CLI surface, MCP tools, event schema\n  [6] observability — Metrics, tracing, logging, telemetry\n  [7] data-model — RDF, SPARQL, ontology, event sourcing\nSelect domains: Add custom domain? (name=description, or enter to skip): \nEnable MCP write tools by default? [y/N]: MCP HTTP port [7777]: Created:\n  .product/config.toml\n  .product/features/\n  .product/adrs/\n  .product/tests/\n  .product/graph/\n  .gitignore\n\nRun `product feature new \"My First Feature\"` to get started.\n" <https://decision-cli.dev/ns/graph/verify-result> .
